### Troubleshooting

**"pywin32 not installed" error:**
```bash
pip install pywin32
python Scripts/pywin32_postinstall.py -install
```

**"Authentication failed" or "permission error":**
- Make sure Outlook is open
- Run Python as Administrator
- Check that your Outlook account is connected

**"No files found":**
- Make sure your emails actually have attachments
- Check the keyword filter matches your email subjects
- Look in other folders (script searches Inbox only)

**DOCX/XLSX files show "WARNING":**
```bash
pip install python-docx openpyxl
```

**Slow performance:**
- Normal for first run with many emails
- Takes longer with large attachments
- Consider filtering by subject to narrow results

