## Python Virtual Environment (Optional but Recommended)

To avoid messing with your system Python:

```bash
# Create virtual environment
python -m venv outlook_search_env

# Activate it
# On Windows:
outlook_search_env\Scripts\activate

# On Mac/Linux:
source outlook_search_env/bin/activate

# Then install packages
pip install pywin32 python-docx openpyxl pandas

# Run script
python outlook_search_simple.py

# Deactivate when done
deactivate
```

