## Permissions & Security

- **pywin32**: Accesses Outlook COM object (same permissions as your account)
- **File reading**: Reads downloaded attachments in temp folder
- **No data sent externally**: Everything runs locally
- **No passwords stored**: Uses your existing Outlook connection

